AB  - This paper presents a comprehensive analysis of artificial intelligence (AI) integration in telehealth platforms, focusing on automated triage systems and personalized care recommendations. We examine how AI technologies are revolutionizing virtual healthcare delivery through improved patient assessment, risk stratification, and customized treatment planning. Through critical analysis of technical implementations and case studies, we evaluate both the benefits and limitations of current AI-driven solutions. Our findings reveal significant improvements in operational efficiency and patient outcomes, while highlighting persistent challenges in data privacy, interoperability, and model interpretability. We conclude with evidence-based recommendations for future development and implementation of AI in telehealth systems.
